            "review_title": "Review at Huong Viet Vietnamese Aroma Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Hey You\nToronto, Canada1234 contributions\n0\nGood food and prices for the Tourist Area\nJan 2020\nMy wife and I ate at the Aroma restaurant on two different occasions. The servers were friendly and understood English for the most part. Service was good on both occasions, first place in Vietnam that serves bottles of beer ice cold with an ice chilled mug.....pizza's were good for me on both occasions....tons of cheese ,,,,wife wasn't impressed with her chicken burger on the first visit....salad on the second visit was okay but lacked taste....lots of selection and seating.\nRead more\nWritten January 30, 2020",
