            "review_text": "Allyskate.travels\nSingapore, Singapore25 contributions\n0\nGood Place to Try Pho (with GAdventures)\nJan 2019 • Friends\nTried Pho here and it was good. Air conditioned with Wifi and even a TV. Toilets available too with toilet paper. \n\nHad a vanilla ice cream milkshake and it was good. I also tried the mini fried pancakes which were chewy and melted in mouth.\n\nWas here with Gadventures tour group.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten January 31, 2019",
